Project Title: Soccer Wunderkind Search
Description: Reviewing soccer data from 2018 to identify features that go into finding the next 'wunderkind'.
Requirements: Must have Excel, Jupyter notebook, and python with followwing libraries-
pandas
numpy
matplotlib.pyplot
seaborn
sklearn.model_selection import train_test_split
sklearn.metrics import mean_squared_error, r2_score
sklearn.linear_model import LinearRegression
sklearn.ensemble import RandomForestRegressor
sklearn.preprocessing import LabelEncoder, StandardScaler
Quick Start: Open file and run via preferred IDE.
